  "description": "This package by Allied Bits offers a number of advanced features compared to the original NCalc project.\n\nNCalc is a fast and lightweight expression evaluator library for .NET, designed for flexibility and high performance. It supports a wide range of mathematical and logical operations and flow control statements (loops and conditions). NCalc can parse any expression and evaluate the result,\nincluding static or dynamic parameters and custom functions. NCalc targets .NET 11, .NET 10, .NET 9, .NET 8, .NET Standard 2.0, and NET Framework 4.7.2 and later.",
